        "text": "A Adjectives connected with size, weight and general appearance"
      },
      {
        "y": 113.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 488.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "She introduced me to a tall, slender woman who looked very serious. [thin in an attractive way]"
      },
      {
        "y": 125.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 426.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "He was too scrawny to be a football player. [unattractively thin and bony-looking]"
      },
      {
        "y": 137.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 408.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A lanky teenager walked in. [very tall and thin, and usually moving awkwardly]"
      },
      {
        "y": 149.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 486.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A gangling/gangly youth approached him. [tall, with long, thin arms and legs and rather awkward"
      },
      {
        "y": 162.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 255.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "movements; often used of men and boys]"
