      {
        "y": 173.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 507.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Recent studies show that an increasing number of children are obese. [very fat, in an unhealthy way]"
      },
      {
        "y": 185.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 527.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "She’s the rather stout woman wearing glasses over there. [with a quite large, solid body; used of men and women]"
